    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.0
      type: 13
      value: <color=#ffffff>New Features / Content</color>
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.1
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Play online with friends: co-op multiplayer for up to 8 players."
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.2
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Enemies scale in strength with the number of players in the
        session."
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.3
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Experience from kills is shared with players in the same encounter."
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.4
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Host sessions with a name, optional password, player cap, and
        visibility."
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.5
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Find games via the public game list, LAN discovery, Steam friends,
        or IP."
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.6
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Accept a Steam invite to jump straight into a friend's session."
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.7
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Games can be set to PVP / Shared Loot as desired."
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.8
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Hardcore and Regular pilots can play together in the same session."
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.9
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Text chat added to HUD in multiplayer games with new keybinding
        to activate."
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.10
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Player list next to Radar shows other players' status and location."
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.11
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 If the host disconnects the game seamlessly drops back into
        single player."
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.12
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Demo includes full multiplayer and can join full-game sessions
        in Sector 1."
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.13
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Dialogs in multiplayer now pause the encounter for everyone
        during combat."
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.14
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Multiplayer dialogs auto-advance on a reading timer so no one
        stays frozen."
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.15
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Player list now shows which players are reading a dialog."
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.8.0.16
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 New multiplayer game list tooltips show each player's name,
