    - key: roadmap.8.description
      type: 9
      value: Arriving in Sector 4, these fixed weapons trade flexibility for raw
        power. Expect massive piercing lasers and oversized projectiles.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.9.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Sector 4 - Phase 1
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.9.description
      type: 9
      value: Return home to Sector 4 (Level 45 - 50) and defend Earth against escalating
        Species-XI and Skeran incursions while Echo completes the first stage of
        her weapon.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.10.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Sector 4 - Phase 2
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.10.description
      type: 9
      value: Continue the fight in Sector 4 (Level 50 - 55) as Phantoms forces join
        the assault while Echo completes the second stage of her weapon.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.11.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Sector 4 - Phase 3
