    - key: uO5YJWRH
      type: 18
      value: Would you like more information on how to use the ship designer?
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: azUvS69L
      type: 18
      value: Yes - Show Tutorial
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: b5kDj7AI
      type: 18
      value: No - Continue
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: P9FNnyxo
      type: 18
      value: 'You can design your ship by selecting parts and moving them around.


        The
        dotted lines indicate the maximum sizes of each ship class. As your ship
        gets bigger it''s class will be increased. Bigger classes are unlocked at
        higher levels.'
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: mKcd0yLm
      type: 18
      value: 'You can add new slots and parts using the part selection at the bottom
        of the ship designer.


        You''ll unlock more parts and different factions
        as you progress.'
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: db51ZfHl
      type: 18
      value: 'There are limits on how many slots and parts you can have. You''ll
        be told if your current design exceeds this.


        The part limit is
        from your ship current class, more slots can be unlocked as you level up.'
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Wz7kxbrf
      type: 18
      value: 'When you select a part you can modify it using the options on the right
        hand side.


        Move parts up or down layers to make them appear above
        or below other parts. You can also rotate, mirror and flip them.'
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Y6BY4Nsr
      type: 18
      value: 'You can use the buttons in the top left to load pre-existing designs
        or save your own for later.


        You can also import and export designs
        to share them with others using the buttons in the bottom right.'
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: U17RpR0X
      type: 9
      value: Continue
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
