  - categoryName: Scene.Main.Extras Canvas
    entries:
    - key: 0cm8nhhq
      type: 16
      value: "Thanks for picking up Star Vortex. I'm developing the game as a solo
        developer in my spare time, and your support means a lot.\r\n\r\n<b>What's
        currently missing?</b>\r\n<color=#89bcde>\r\n\u2022 Sector 4, conclusion
        of the main story.\r\n\u2022 Final end-game where you enter the void.\r\n\u2022
        Siege Encounters where you fight space stations.\r\n\u2022 Lots of legendary
        weapons and variants.\r</color>\r\n\r\nUpdates land every few weeks with
        new content and improvements. Got feedback, suggestions, or bug reports?
        Drop them in the #feedback channel on our Discord!\r\n\r\nThanks again, enjoy
        the game!"
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: kZVs20Ft
      type: 9
      value: View Early Access Roadmap
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: MW1ZaFJf
      type: 16
      value: 'Welcome to demo version of Star Vortex. If you have any feedback, suggestions
        or bug reports please join us on Discord and let me know.


        This
        demo includes all the content of the game up until the end of the first Sector
        which is around about level 20. The full game has additional sectors, weapons,
        races, ship parts and much more.


        Star Vortex is made by myself
        <b>a solo-developer</b> in my free time. Thanks for playing!'
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: dOyphhuL
      type: 9
      value: View Early Access Roadmap
      baseValue: 
      context: 
