      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: jE1FAU9n
      type: 8
      value: 'To improve our game, we would like to collect anonymized statistics
        and data about your play sessions, progress, crashes and performance.


        This
        involves using a third-party service called "Unity Analytics". All data is
        sent anonymously and cannot be traced back to you.


        Our privacy
        policy can be found at: <color=#89bcde>https://huntedcow.com/privacy-policy/</color>


        You
        can enable or disable this at any time under the Advanced Settings tab.'
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: AMLLy4mq
      type: 9
      value: Do Not Send
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: b7PYrOq6
      type: 9
      value: Send Data
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: GZLozQXD
      type: 9
      value: Demo Information
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EkEE1zgi
      type: 8
      value: "You're playing the <color=#89bcde>Demo</color> of Star Vortex. \n\nAlthough
        this version is kept up to date with all the latest features <color=#89bcde>you
        will not be able to proceed past the end of Sector 1</color>. However, <b>any
        progress you make will transfer to the full game</b> when it is released.\n\nThe
        full game is out in Early Access now so if you want to try it out you can!\n\n<color=#89bcde>Steam
        players wont be awarded any achievements in Steam. They'll be retro-actively
        awarded in the full game though!</color>"
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: ALDKgoUc
      type: 9
      value: Browser Version
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: k80TWFDG
      type: 8
      value: "You're playing the <color=#89bcde>Browser Demo</color> of Star Vortex.
        \n\nAlthough there are hours of gameplay in this version <color=#89bcde>you
        will not be able to proceed past the end of Sector 1</color>.\n\nThe full
        game is out in Early Access now so if you want to try it out you can find
        it on Steam or the Epic store."
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SfiZVcmg
      type: 9
      value: Early Access
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PmNCh8qJ
      type: 8
      value: 'Thanks for picking up <color=#89bcde>Star Vortex</color>! I''m developing
        the game as a solo developer in my spare time and getting to this point has
        been a wild ride.


        The <b>story currently ends after Sector 3</b>
        with more content already in the pipeline. If you hit a bug, something feels
        off, or you''ve got an idea to improve the game, I''d love to hear it. You
        can drop your feedback in our Discord.


        Enjoy the game, and thanks
        again for the support!'
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qCHINMmm
      type: 9
      value: Early Access Roadmap
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
