      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: d0PwM3QM
      type: 8
      value: 'Thanks for taking the time to checkout the demo!


        Star Vortex
        is out now in Early Access! Grab your copy on Steam and continue your journey.
        All saves carry over to the full version!'
