  - categoryName: Scene.Game.HUD Tutorial Helper
    entries:
    - key: OG7Lffb1
      type: 18
      value: You can use your tractor beam to pull in nearby item containers.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: D4tpv9Eg
      type: 18
      value: You can turn, accelerate and stabilize your ship using the controls
        below.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: GgnYo5Si
      type: 18
      value: Hold the dodge key and press any direction to dodge and avoid enemies.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 8ksGCocz
      type: 18
      value: Hold down the dodge modifier and move in a direction to dodge that way.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 40aaJoXo
      type: 18
      value: Use the boost button if you need to get somewhere quickly.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: A3xhd830
      type: 18
      value: Primary weapons generate heat when used, overheating will disable them.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 8yy9WQ8e
      type: 18
      value: Toggle turret mode to aim your weapons independently from your ship.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qjFmgpCP
      type: 18
      value: You can aim separately from your ship using the controls below.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: YOcC3mqm
      type: 18
      value: The core panel contains upgrades, equipment, missions and navigation.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: D8bNqsfe
      type: 18
      value: Shoot one of the nearby asteroids for target practice.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: mtEKYWW3
      type: 18
      value: You have completed a mission. It can be collected from the <color=#ffc600>Mission
        Panel</color>.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: jXjkzH27
      type: 18
      value: Move toward the mothership and press <color=#ffc600>interact</color>
        to dock.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: sfgfxbnx
      type: 18
      value: You can hyperdrive jump between encounters for faster travel.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Xg6o3rEX
      type: 18
      value: Place the <color=#ffc600>Sector Keystone</color> into the Secor Gateway
        at <color=#ffc600>Novus Prime</color>.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xwPjwzi8
      type: 18
      value: <color=#ffc600>Shield Resistance</color> will make you immune to debuffs
        of that type.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: r6IBC7w9
      type: 18
      value: You can now unlock an additional slot in the <color=#ffc600>Upgrades</color>
        panel.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hPHo23Bg
      type: 18
      value: Additional ship classes are available in <color=#ffc600>Ship Design</color>
        at the <color=#ffc600>Mothership</color>.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: ArqiBaTi
      type: 18
      value: You can link <color=#DB5656>Secondary Weapon</color> and <color=#7756DB>Special</color>
        slots in the equipment panel.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hmkSTF8r
      type: 18
      value: Boosting at high speed makes you <color=#DA5F00>invulnerable</color>
        and disables weapons.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: vAJLXeSx
      type: 18
      value: Open the <color=#ffc600>Navigation Panel</color> to locate the Assembler
        on the sector map.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Yl7Tc7Bv
      type: 18
      value: Waypoints are <color=#ffc600>permanent unlocks</color> and can still
        be jumped to after the sector is regenerated.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: FFlVzdh8
      type: 18
      value: Use the <color=#ff441b>Infected Seed</color> on a <color=#ffc600>Waypoint</color>
        if you want to fight more Species-XI enemies.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
