    - key: GlossaryPanel.statusEffectReactionsIntro
      type: 9
      value: When an enemy carries two of these debuffs at the same time, a reaction
        fires. Both debuffs stay applied, but no reaction can trigger on that enemy
        again for 1 second. The diagram shows which pairs trigger which reaction.
        Both the damage and the debuff chance on a reaction's hits come from the
        weapon that applied the triggering debuff, so reactions can chain into more
        reactions.
