  - categoryName: Resource.FixedStar
    entries:
    - key: rYaZS5Ys.name
      type: 5
      value: Alpha Saxa
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.name
      type: 5
      value: Astralis
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: About time I saw a friendly face! Where's ol' Gid?
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: Novus Prime... I'll send you the coordinates.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: Hyperdrive's actin' up... bloody thing's got a mind of its own. I'll
        need a wee bit o' time. Keep those hostiles off me, will ya?
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.name
      type: 5
      value: Avalon
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Your incursion ends here. You are hopelessly outmatched!
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: I wouldn't be so sure about that.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: All ships, focus fire on the Citadel. This ends here!
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.fleeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Hull's about to give. I'm getting the crew clear... it's on you now.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.completeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Good work. Now, go place that keystone in the sector gateway. We're
        not done yet!
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: shBT47eM.name
      type: 5
      value: Infernum
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: shBT47eM.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: That's a big snake...
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: shBT47eM.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: I'll spare you the obvious joke...
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.name
      type: 5
      value: Nightfall
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Damn cultists. I bet they believe in aliens.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: Did you miss all the aliens we've been fighting?
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: Forgotten are the memories of the future!
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: Whatever. Just don't drink any of their Kool-Aid.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: gkWSs2X1.name
      type: 5
      value: Novus Prime
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: z8m42dFQ.name
      type: 5
      value: Periculum
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.name
      type: 5
      value: Serenity
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: You can't take the sky from me!
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: What are you talking about?
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: Just something from one of the TV series I kept.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: I'm going to show you a world without sin.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.4
      type: 2
      value: See? He got the reference...
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.name
      type: 5
      value: Virenum
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: I'm detecting dangerously high levels of radiation.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: Isn't that just space in general?
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: This is higher than normal. That ship is leaking it everywhere.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: Great. Just what we needed...
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: R2NUkvrp.name
      type: 5
      value: Waypoint Alpha
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: wErwJOkj.name
      type: 5
      value: Waypoint Beta
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: UcQcZrfr.name
      type: 5
      value: Waypoint Gamma
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: TEyzaBb4.name
      type: 5
      value: Asgard
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.name
      type: 5
      value: Bastion
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: A Conclave ship... unexpected. Do you come to see what freedom truly
        looks like?
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: I go where I need to.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: Then take a good look. This is what the Conclave fears, what it could
        never control.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: I kind of like these guys...
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 15rTZw3b.name
      type: 5
      value: "Bifr\xF6st"
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 15rTZw3b.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: Oh, look! Double trouble. A pair teaming up... just like us!
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 15rTZw3b.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: I wonder which one is the brains...
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: W48tqWIi.name
      type: 5
      value: Genesis
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.name
      type: 5
      value: Nilfheim
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: You charge toward the Prism like all conquerors before you... blind
        to what you do not understand.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.arrivalDialog.2
