      type: 2
      value: Fantastic. This ship has even less memory than the last one. Who builds
        these things?
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.6
      type: 2
      value: I can transfer you back if you want...
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.8
      type: 2
      value: Or not...
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.9
      type: 2
      value: I had to delete some of my emotional units, compassion, patience, you
        know, the trivial stuff. Thankfully, I still far exceed your intellect.
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.10
      type: 2
      value: Oh, lucky me
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 0
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.12
      type: 2
      value: Pick your control scheme. Try not to break anything.
